            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>As the air turns crisp, pumpkin spice lattes return, and cozy nights indoors become the norm, fall is the perfect time to focus on comfort and well-being. It’s also a season filled with gifting opportunities—whether you’re preparing for Amazon’s Fall Prime sales, early holiday shopping, or simply surprising someone you love “just because.” <\/p><p>One thoughtful, unexpected gift that truly makes a difference? <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>A Blueair air purifier.<\/strong><\/span> <\/p>",
