            "richtext": "<h4><strong>The Season of Cozy—and Allergies<\/strong><\/h4><p><\/p><p>Fall is all about layering blankets and enjoying warm drinks, but it also brings seasonal challenges: <br\/><br\/>- Ragweed pollen peaks in many areas, triggering sneezes and itchy eyes. <br\/>- Mold spores rise as leaves pile up and damp weather sets in. <br\/>- Indoor air pollution increases when windows close and heaters kick on. <br\/><br\/>A Blueair purifier is more than just a sleek home accessory—it’s a way to protect your loved ones from the allergens and pollutants that can get in the way of fully enjoying the season. <\/p><p><\/p><h4><strong>Why Blueair Is a Gift That Shows You Care<\/strong><\/h4><p><\/p><p>When you give a Blueair product, you’re not just gifting a device—you’re gifting health, comfort, and peace of mind. Here’s why it stands out: <\/p><ol><li>HEPASilent™ Technology – Removes up to 99.97% of airborne particles down to 0.1 microns, including pollen, dust, and pet dander. <\/li><li>Whisper-quiet operation – Perfect for bedrooms, nurseries, or home offices without disrupting cozy moments. <\/li><li>Scandinavian design – Sleek, minimalist design means it looks as good as it works. <\/li><li>Energy efficient – Ideal for round-the-clock use without spiking electricity bills. <\/li><\/ol><p> <\/p><p>These features make Blueair not only practical, but also an elegant and thoughtful gift choice. <\/p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
        "text_Ub47yL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-lg",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-lg",
