            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-md",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Gifting Ideas for Fall<\/strong><\/h4><p><\/p><p>Whether you’re shopping for family, friends, or even coworkers, there’s a Blueair model that fits perfectly: <\/p><ul><li><strong>For the homebody:<\/strong> A purifier in the living room helps make movie nights healthier and more comfortable. <\/li><li><strong>For parents:<\/strong> Cleaner air in nurseries and playrooms helps little ones sleep soundly and breathe easier.  <\/li><li><strong>For pet lovers:<\/strong> Keep dander and odors at bay while creating a fresher, more inviting home. <\/li><li><strong>For students or professionals:<\/strong> A desktop purifier for dorms or home offices helps boost focus and well-being. <\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h1><\/h1><h4><strong>The Perfect Timing: Amazon Fall Prime Sales<\/strong><\/h4><p><\/p><p>Amazon’s Fall Prime sales are the perfect time to grab deals on big-ticket items like Blueair. If you’re planning for the holidays, or want to surprise someone this season, taking advantage of seasonal discounts makes this premium gift even more accessible. <\/p><p>With fast shipping and special offers, you can check off your list early while giving a gift that truly lasts. <\/p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
